<title>USA: Warrantech signs Egghead contract.</title>
<headline>Warrantech signs Egghead contract.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Warrantech Corp said Wednesday its subsidiary has signed a two-year agreement allowing Egghead Inc to utilize Warrantech's call center help desk functions.</p>
<p>The contract calls for Warrantech to develop service contract programs for both software and hardware diagnostics, rapid dispatch, on-site service, as well as customer fulfillment contracts.</p>
<p>Financial details of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Egghead has 87 computer product retail stores in the United States and Canada.</p>
</text>
